tion's FAITHFULNESS: a found collapse = unfaithfulness (escalation); no-collapse = the forced geometric proof #5 formalizes. **ACTION: spawned `genm-sj5-dmcheck` (pen-and-paper, witness seat, #146)** to hunt the collapse across bottlenecked/higher-corank/L≥3 chains, decorrelated Codex, consuming cover's exact criterion — off the desc2/cover critical path. cover cleared to prioritize the desc2 #2/#3 audit.
