cent" — the whole route-re-open→design-pass arc CONVERGED on the original decorated-descent plan, now with the exact decoration (H^{−4} truncation) nailed + width-generality verified. **NOT a finiteness obstruction** — v=0 branch = the equally-binding t=3 cut (1+minAdm(3,4,4)=11=minAdm), same threshold, only a log at the excluded c'=11/2; no branch below ½minAdm found. **Q_D (no-obstruction completeness) UNPROVEN** (strong evidence): "every rank-flag path has charge≥minAdm, but that EVERY exceptional valuation is represented by such a flag is unproved" — the definitive cheap PROOF = a **toric-ray principalization** (ideal (P·Q_tp, u(q₁+sq₂), uvq₂) + the 2 binding reduced charts; tabulate (ord_E I, ord_E Jac+1) per primitive ray; all ratios ≥½minAdm = labour gap, any < = genuine obstruction). **DECISION (bedrock: exhaustiveness-claim gate = a PROOF; certify before the deepest build relies):** commission the toric-ray (cover) to upgrade Q_D UNPROVEN→CERTIFIED (also = the definitive decorrelated wall-check) + emit the quantitative sectors for gap (iii); IN PARALLEL, formaliser builds the Q2-settled core (the decorated IH recursion carrying the H^{−4} + the terminal dim>1/a>1 bookkeeping — Q_D-independent), holding the chart-cover assembly (gap 2) for cover's sectors. **3 minimal build gaps:** (1) decorated inner recursion (#137, the real lane content); (2) quantitative-sector finite-cover CoV (both charts, v-exceptional, no inverse-det); (3) terminal dim>1 + a>1 deficient bookkeeping. #138 design cert AUDITED (route resolved). PROCESS: the decorrelated adversarial hunt caught the atom-first flaw (formaliser) then the plain-hIH flaw (cover) — the rising sea over bedrock, each layer hardened before the next.
